OL,3,GNEWSA'I stockpiled 600 cans of food for
OL,4,Aan emergency'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who purchased 600 cans of food in
OL,7,Fcase of an emergency has said that it
OL,8,Fis something he began to do following
OL,9,Fthe start of the war in Ukraine and
OL,10,FCovid-19 pandemic.
OL,12,FThe government has told us to have
OL,13,Fthree days' worth of food and water on
OL,14,Fhand to get through a national
OL,15,Femergency in its 'Be Ready' campaign.
OL,17,FIan Ferguson from Weymouth, Dorset has
OL,18,Fbeen collecting tins for the last two
OL,19,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
